is<br>Video Production: Polygon Pictures<br><br><strong>Cast:</strong><br>Niina Nijikawa: Maria Sashide<br>Shikiri Shiishiba: Mariko Toribe<br>Mikasa Minowa: Natsumi Hioka<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689710/extras/06297145d0706a3ba51fcff7da719d93.avif?t=1723879582\" width=600 height=200 /></span>",
